---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Tags
description: Browse all blog tags.
permalink: /tags/index.html
---
<section class="listing-heading container">
  <p class="eyebrow">Find a thread</p>
  <h1>Tags</h1>
  <p class="lede">从一个主题进入这些笔记。</p>
</section>
<section class="tag-cloud container" aria-label="全部标签">
  {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
    {% set taggedPosts = collections.blogPosts | postsForTag(tag) %}
    <a href="/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/">
      <span>{{ tag }}</span>
      <small>{{ taggedPosts.length }} 篇</small>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
